 In a previous article, bpatr@ntua.gr (Babis Patrikakis) says:
 (note: This song was tabbed from the Black Sabbath version)

                       PARANOID - MEGADETH

 The following chords are the only ones used in this song (G2 means
 only an alternative formation for G, it's not Gsus2 or something).

 E     D     G     C     G2
 -------------------------------
 ------------------------12-----
 ------------12----10----12-----
 14----12----12----10----12-----
 14----12----10----8------------
 12----10-----------------------

 Here are the rhythm figures used in the song (2'-' = 8th note)

 FIGURE 1A

 E-E-E-E-E-E-E-E-|E-E-E-E-E-E-E-E-|D-D-D-D-D-D-D-D-|G-D-----E---G2--|

 FIGURE 1B

 E-E-E-E-E-E-E-E-|E-E-E-E-E-E-E-E-|D-D-D-D-D-D-D-D-|G-D-----E-------|

 FIGURE 2

 E---------------|C-------D-------|E-E-E-E-E-E-E-E-|E-E-E-E-E-E-E-E-|

 FIGURE 3

 E---------------|----------------|D---------------|----------------|

 INTRO (4'-' = 8th note)
 --------------------------------|--------------------------------|
 --------------------------------|--------------------------------|
 --------------------------------|--------------------------------|
 --------------------------------|--------12-h14----------12------|
 (12)h14-----(12)h14-----(12)h14-|12-h14----------12-h14------14--|
 12----------12----------12------|--------------------------------|

 KEY:
 h = hammer on
 (12) = this note hardly takes time to sound

 Finally, song flow and lyrics (Figure 1 = Figure 1A + Figure 1B)

 [INTRO] X4
 w/Figure 1
 Finished with my woman cause she couldn't help me with my mind
 People think I'm insane because I am frowning all the time
 [Figure 2] X2
 w/Figure 1
 All day long I think of things but nothing seems to satisfy
 Think I'll lose my mind if I don't find something to pacify
 w/Figure 3
 Can you help me? Are you for my brain? Oh yeah!
 [Figure 1A] X2
 w/Figure 1
 I need someone to show me the things in life that I can't find
 I can't see the things that make true happiness I must be blind
 [Solo over Figure 1A]
 [Figure 1A] X2
 w/Figure 1
 Make a joke and I will sigh and you will laugh and I will cry
 Happiness I cannot feel and love to me is so unreal
 [Figure 2] X2
 w/Figure 1A
 And so as you hear these words telling you now of my state
 I tell you to enjoy life I wish i could but it's too late
